# DEFINED_IN edge schema
# DomainTerm -> BoundedContext (generated from domain_term.bounded_context column)
# This edge is generated at graph build time — no separate CSV required
# generated: from domain_term.bounded_context
# references: term_id -> domain_term, bc_id -> bounded_context
term_id,bc_id
# term_id: Source DomainTerm ID (from domain_term.id)
# bc_id: Target BoundedContext ID (from domain_term.bounded_context)
